.TH DIRECT-RDP 1 "November 2026" "direct-rdp 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
direct-rdp \- remote desktop client for RDP and VNC
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B direct-rdp
[\fIrdp://host[:port]\fR | \fIvnc://host[:port]\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B direct-rdp
connects to Windows computers over RDP and to Macs and Linux desktops over VNC.
Saved computers are kept in \fI~/.config/direct-rdp/connections.ini\fR and
passwords in the desktop keyring.
.PP
When given an \fBrdp://\fR or \fBvnc://\fR address it connects to it straight away.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/Lidanha/direct-rdp
